                    Subject Files, Items to Discuss with the President 8/13–12/30/69. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d74-f2" n="2" xml:id="d74-f2-content">
                <p>Nixon approved on October 9. See <ref
                        target="#d73">Document 73</ref> and footnote 3 thereto.</p>
            </note>
